---
kind: lore
id: isles.radio
title: The Sunfall morning report
---

// AREA isles: Radio Verdane's island report, once each morning, for every
// beacon that burned the night before (dayStart, a select: sequence
// occasion raised for no target).

<entry id="islesBeaconReport" on="dayStart" for="kind:island" category="bark" when="holds('islesRelit', [occasion.target])">
  @announcer: The {{occasion.target}} beacon burned all night. The island boats report calm water.
</entry>
